     2352           .
     2353         end.
     2354       end.
     2355     end.
     2356     else do:
     2357       for each buff-obj-list no-lock
     2358         where xtog-obj = false
     2359            or (buff-obj-list.obj-type = x-store-type
     2360               and buff-obj-list.obj-code = x-store-code
     2361               )
     2362       on error undo, return error
