     5098     put stream out-stream v-line format "X(170)" at 10 skip.
     5099     for each obj-list no-lock
     5100       break by obj-list.obj-type
     5101             by obj-list.obj-code
     5102     :
     5103       run fmtcli-get-client in this-procedure
     5104               ( input  obj-list.obj-type
